    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d118">

                <pb facs="0303" n="229" xml:id="pg229"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the President’s Special Assistant</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-01-11">January 11,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Problems To Be
                        Settled</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d118-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <list>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>In what way can Russia, China, the Dutch, the United States and the
                        British Commonwealth of Nations be associated in some type of joint body to
                        plan the united war effort?</item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <list>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>What joint organization should be responsible for advice and planning for
                        theaters of war outside of the Far East?</item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
